Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:24:00.39,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(200,0)}I waved my hand, saying, "I'll see you next time"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.39,0:24:05.39,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(0,620)}I forced a smile, then I was lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:16.75,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(200,620)}Traffic lights at the intersection...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.75,0:24:20.26,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(200,620)}The distant sound of a car honking...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.26,0:24:27.29,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(0,620)}The voices of strangers laughing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.29,0:24:31.14,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3}Today, I walk alone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.14,0:24:34.99,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3}Even though I'm used to the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.99,0:24:39.50,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3}I feel just a little smaller
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.50,0:24:45.09,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(0,620)}than my usual self
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.26,0:24:50.26,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(200,0)}I wave my hand, saying, "I'll see you next time"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.26,0:24:55.37,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(0,620)}I made a smile, then I was lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.37,0:25:01.79,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(0,620)}Even though I want to talk even more with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.79,0:25:05.64,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3}Saying, "I'll see you next time,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:10.73,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(0,620)}Lying about seeing each other again
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.73,0:25:16.47,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3}I say, with my usual smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.47,0:25:19.88,Ending-MataAshita-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be3\fad(0,1020)}"See you tomorrow."
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tomoe Mami.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.46,0:00:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a third-year at your school,\N Mitakihara Junior High.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.39,0:00:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm a magical girl who formed a contract with Kyubey.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.98,0:00:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Another weird dream...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.03,0:00:50.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:20.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.68,0:02:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, I heard you came home late last night.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An upperclassman from school\N invited me to her house.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.55,0:02:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be an annoying mom \Nand impose a curfew and stuff,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:33.73,0:02:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but make sure you call home before dinner.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess no one else can see him.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.12,0:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful room!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.12,0:03:07.34,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:08.09,0:03:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I live alone, so make yourselves at home.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.80,0:03:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I admit you've caught me unprepared.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.72,0:03:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san}, this is delicious!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.87,0:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.02,0:03:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you've been chosen by Kyubey,\Nthat means you two are now involved in this.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.73,0:03:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should get everyone on the same page.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.55,0:03:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:32.46,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask us anything at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:34.23,0:03:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}, you have that backwards.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.55,0:03:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's pretty!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.44,0:03:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Soul Gem.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.00,0:03:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When Kyubey forms a contract with a girl, a Soul Gem is born.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.88,0:03:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what identifies us as magical girls\Nand acts as the source of our power.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.38,0:03:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Contract, you said?{cps}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.26,0:03:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can grant each of you one wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of wish?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.75,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you want.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fulfill any miracle you wish for.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.55,0:04:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So it could be gold, silver,\N priceless treasures, immortality...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.60,0:04:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even a feast fit for a Chinese emperor!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.85,0:04:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too sure about that last one...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.99,0:04:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for that wish,\N a Soul Gem is produced.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.09,0:04:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who receive one are given the responsibility of fighting witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.58,0:04:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Witches?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.07,0:04:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.59,0:04:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.94,0:04:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What if... What if someone offered to grant you any wish you wanted with magic...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.71,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you—
Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.52,0:04:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd get rid of a board member or two.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.31,0:04:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The president is also getting a bit too old for this,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.47,0:04:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so maybe I would wish for him to retire...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.40,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But he hasn't even named a successor yet...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.73,0:04:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you became president then, Mom?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.61,0:05:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.01,0:05:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to work things out \Nwith the Sales Department first.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.96,0:05:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Planning and Administration\N are already my puppets.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.35,0:05:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The only problem left\N is the baldy in Accounting.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:10.86,0:05:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just pull off his toupée.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:12.17,0:05:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, you look scary.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.97,0:05:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a witch?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they different from magical girls?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.55,0:05:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If magical girls are born from wishes,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.93,0:05:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,then witches are born from curses.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.44,0:05:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical girls spread hope, \Nwhereas witches spread despair.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.30,0:05:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And to make matters worse, \Nthey can't be seen by normal humans.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.89,0:05:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Doubt and suspicion, irrational rage and hatred...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:40.43,0:05:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They sow the seeds of catastrophe in this world.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:43.62,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Many inexplicable suicides and murders that occur are caused by a witch's curse.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.25,0:05:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a formless evil that eats away at humans from the inside.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.01,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're so dangerous, then how come no one knows about them?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:00.01,0:06:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because witches hide within barriers \Nand never show themselves to people.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.89,0:06:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The labyrinth-like area you wandered into before was one.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.89,0:06:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty dangerous, actually.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.85,0:06:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who are swallowed up by the barriers don't usually live to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san}, are you really fighting something that dangerous?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.66,0:06:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.47,0:06:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes my life is in danger too.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.20,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I think you two should weigh your options carefully.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.54,0:06:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've been chosen by Kyubey, \Nyou can have any wish granted.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,However, doing so could lead to your death.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a tough decision.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.63,0:06:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To help you make up your minds,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.76,0:06:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you come along \Nwith me on a witch hunt?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.06,0:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.64,0:06:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you can see what\N it's like to fight a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.64,0:06:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And afterwards, you should take the time and think about
Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.65,0:06:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,whether having your wish\N come true is worth your life.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.65,0:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.43,0:07:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.65,0:07:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good mor—
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:09.21,0:07:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Sayaka{**-san}?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.28,0:07:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're really the only ones who can see him?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.62,0:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.74,0:07:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.51,0:07:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:23.81,0:07:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks like we can also talk to each other telepathically.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, so we already have magical powers?!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.60,0:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, no. I'm just using myself\N to relay your thoughts.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.77,0:07:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's pretty convenient though, isn't it?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.29,0:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels a bit strange.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.40,0:07:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on with you two?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep staring into each other's eyes.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.82,0:07:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, we've been... Um...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't say it!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.44,0:07:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two already close enough to\N communicate through your eyes alone?!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:55.57,0:07:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you've become so close\N to each other after just one day.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.42,0:08:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What on Earth happened yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.19,0:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, uh... you've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.76,0:08:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot {\i1}did{\i0} happen last night, though.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.43,0:08:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't! You're both girls!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.33,0:08:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a love that can never be!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.79,0:08:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot your bag!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.39,0:08:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi{**-chan}'s acting a bit like you today.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.11,0:08:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:35.67,0:08:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it okay for you to come with us to school like nothing's happened?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.50,0:08:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why wouldn't it be?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.01,0:08:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you that the girl from yesterday transferred into this class, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.95,0:08:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wasn't she trying to kill you?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.39,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I actually think the school\N is the safest place for me.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mami's here too.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:53.59,0:08:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mami{**-san}'s a third-year, so her \Nclass is kind of far from here.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.40,0:08:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.88,0:09:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can hear everything you're saying.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:00.95,0:09:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even at this distance, we can still communicate with her.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.14,0:09:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}U-Uh... good morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.47,0:09:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll keep a close eye on you all, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.41,0:09:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, I'm pretty sure she wouldn't attack any of you in public.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.94,0:09:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn. Speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.05,0:09:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So is that transfer student also an, uh... \Nwhat was it? Magical girl?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.11,0:09:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you, Mami{**-san}?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.31,0:09:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.95,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems quite powerful too.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.96,0:09:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that make her one of the good guys fighting evil witches?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:40.95,0:09:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she suddenly attack Madoka, then?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.94,0:09:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She was after me.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.72,0:09:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine she was trying to stop \Nthe creation of new magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:50.95,0:09:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.99,0:09:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Wouldn't it be better to have \Nmore people fighting the same enemy?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not necessarily the case.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.08,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually more common for us to compete with each other.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.14,0:10:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Why?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:04.34,0:10:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There are rewards for eliminating a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:08.07,0:10:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, in some cases, it turns into a contest,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.06,0:10:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and magical girls may even fight over them.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.85,0:10:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So basically, she predicted that \NKyubey would try to talk to Madoka,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.67,0:10:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's why she's been pestering\NMadoka since this morning?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.23,0:10:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's most likely the case.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.39,0:10:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't worry, Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.16,0:10:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she tries to do anything,\N I'll punch her lights out!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've even got Mami{**-san} here.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.53,0:10:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.49,0:10:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miki{**-san}'s ability to protect you aside,\NI'm with you, so everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.53,0:10:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.65,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't put me aside!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.43,0:10:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So, as we've learned thus far,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.56,0:10:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}a phrase is in the "active voice" when the subject—\Na person or thing—performs the action.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.77,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}In contrast, a phrase is in the "passive voice" when the subject receives the action.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.70,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Passive voice is formed by an auxiliary verb with the participle of a transitive verb.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.20,0:11:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}For instance, if I were to say, "He likes me," \Nor "{\i1}kare wa watashi no koto ga suki{\i0}"—
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.99,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.55,0:11:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.27,0:11:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you come up with a wish yet?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.69,0:11:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. What about you?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.28,0:11:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:29.22,0:11:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of thought a whole bunch \Nof things would pop into my mind...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.95,0:11:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there are a bunch of\N things I want to have and do,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.37,0:11:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but when risking our lives\N is the catch... you know?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.19,0:11:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think anything I\N want is worth that risk.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's surprising.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.81,0:11:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Most girls answer immediately.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.45,0:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're just idiots.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.61,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You really think so?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.56,0:11:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. Blissfully ignorant idiots.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.59,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a wish you'd trade your life for \Nshouldn't be all that uncommon.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.56,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a lot of people in \Nthe world have a wish like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we can't think of anything,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.79,0:12:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,then it must mean we haven't\N faced much misfortune.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:21.72,0:12:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Living such a sheltered life\N has made us ignorant.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.72,0:12:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But why us... of all people?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.02,0:12:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's unfair?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.04,0:12:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are other people who'd\N give anything for a chance like this.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.62,0:12:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.27,0:12:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.26,0:13:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Picking up where you left off yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.01,0:13:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not my intention.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.27,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I had hoped to settle things before he made contact with Kaname Madoka,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's too late for that now.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.22,0:13:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So what will you do?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you two decided to\N become magical girls as well?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.57,0:13:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.97,0:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what I told you yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.45,0:13:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.96,0:13:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, then.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.44,0:13:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that my warning won't fall on deaf ears.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.34,0:13:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho... Homura{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.43,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What... wish did you make \Nto become a magical girl?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.62,0:14:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hitomi.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a few things to do today.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.47,0:14:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, something secret?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.80,0:14:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.41,0:14:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.29,0:14:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can come between \Nyou two anymore, can they?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.93,0:14:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, you're really misunderstanding us...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.25,0:14:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi{**-san}, wanna come to a café with us?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.14,0:14:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something I need to\N take care of again today.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.27,0:14:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.98,0:14:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's begin our first lesson on the magical girl experience.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:41.66,0:14:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two ready?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.95,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if it'll help, but I brought this!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be better than nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.97,0:14:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's good to see you're\N mentally prepared to fight.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, did you bring anything?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.59,0:15:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, I have this...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.61,0:15:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I figured I might as well\N think about the costume.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.74,0:15:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're enthusiastic, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.69,0:15:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.26,0:15:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't top that.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.02,0:15:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reacting to the remnants of the magic used by that witch we faced yesterday.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:34.25,0:15:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for witches basically involves a lot of walking.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.63,0:15:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All you do is follow the Soul Gem as it traces the witch's presence.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.89,0:15:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty lame.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.15,0:15:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The light hasn't changed at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.05,0:15:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a whole day since it escaped.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.25,0:15:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's very little left to track.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:57.30,0:16:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you had gone after it yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:00.28,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have been able to defeat it,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.87,0:16:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't worth leaving you two behind.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.17,0:16:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.29,0:16:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san}'s one of the good guys!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.62,0:16:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, that transfer \Nstudent really gets on my nerves!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:20.64,0:16:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if she's really that bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.88,0:16:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mami{**-san}. Do you have any idea of where the witch might be?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.77,0:16:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Witches' curses tend to cause traffic accidents and assaults.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.28,0:16:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So I prioritize major highways and entertainment districts where accidents and brawls are likely,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.55,0:16:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as desolate places\N that are perfect for suicides.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.91,0:17:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst case scenario is when they haunt places like hospitals.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.63,0:17:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a pretty sight when they drain \Nthe life out of those in a weakened state.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reacting to some very powerful magic.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.78,0:17:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be close.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.36,0:17:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be here!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.06,0:17:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san}, look!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.30,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A witch's kiss.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.05,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.14,0:17:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.40,0:17:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:55.28,0:17:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just unconscious.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.51,0:17:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.82,0:18:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away today!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:17.51,0:18:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.23,0:18:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special, but at the very least it'll help protect you.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you stay by my side, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.34,0:18:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.11,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away! Stay away!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.16,0:18:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you two scared?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.86,0:18:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is nothing!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.79,0:19:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm scared, but...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:13.27,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the barrier's core!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.30,0:19:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that's a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.84,0:19:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.71,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to fight that?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.97,0:19:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:56.61,0:19:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.71,0:20:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san}!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:45.69,0:20:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just embarrass myself in front of my future protégés.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:03.02,0:21:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Close, but no cigar.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.55,0:21:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tiro Finale!{\i0}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.92,0:21:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She won?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.83,0:21:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.74,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Grief Seed.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.28,0:21:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a witch's egg.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Egg?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.16,0:21:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're lucky, sometimes\N a witch will have one.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:49.44,0:21:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.63,0:21:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe in that form.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.83,0:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's extremely useful.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.87,0:21:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My Soul Gem is a bit darker \Nthan it was last night, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:59.93,0:22:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.23,0:22:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,However, by using a Grief Seed...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.27,0:22:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.68,0:22:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all clean.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.44,0:22:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the magic I've depleted\N has been replenished.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:13.71,0:22:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of the rewards I mentioned earlier.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be able to use it one more time.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.35,0:22:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:30.69,0:22:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi Homura{**-san}.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:32.17,0:22:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:34.67,0:22:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you not like to share?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:38.17,0:22:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your prey.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.33,0:22:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You should keep it for yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.68,0:22:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So that's your answer.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.57,0:22:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That antisocial bitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:55.59,0:22:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we could all just get along.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If only everyone felt that same way.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.44,0:23:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:06.81,0:23:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was I doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:11.01,0:23:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why was I...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:14.17,0:23:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I do that?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:17.22,0:23:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Everything's okay now.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:20.17,0:23:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just having a bad dream.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:24.45,0:23:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like our hero saved the day.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:27.56,0:23:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:29.77,0:23:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's too hard for me to come up \Nwith a wish on such short notice,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:36.44,0:23:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the sight of Mami{**-san} pouring her \Nheart into saving others was really amazing.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:42.94,0:23:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If someone like me can really help other people,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:48.08,0:23:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think that'd be really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:56.00,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:26.09,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.91,0:25:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I'm just acting cool,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:29.02,0:25:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}but I have no one to talk \Nwith when I'm scared or sad...
Dialogue: 5,0:25:32.44,0:25:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I'm forced to cry all alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:34.48,0:25:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Being a magical girl \Nreally isn't that great.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:38.06,0:25:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I'm not scared of anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.13,0:01:28.76,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:30.83,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:34.44,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:55.89,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:11.58,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:53.75,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:56.21,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.21,0:00:57.83,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.83,0:01:01.71,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:17.82,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:24.13,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.87,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.87,0:02:20.00,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
